#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84_Chief Executive Officer"
msgid "There's some sort of a commotion over by the arena.\\r\nWhat did I miss?"
msgstr "Parece que hay algún alboroto por la arena.\\r\n¿Me perdí de algo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "96_Chief Operating Officer"
msgid "Didn't you hear? The Florist just hosted an exhibition match\\r\nbetween a new contender and the reigning champ."
msgstr "¿No te enteraste? El Florista montó un combate de exhibición\\r \nentre un nuevo retador y el actual campeón."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108_Chief Executive Officer"
msgid "Oh, so that's why the casino emptied out..."
msgstr "Oh, entonces por eso no hay ni un alma en el casino..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "120_Chief Operating Officer"
msgid "It was the battle of the century! The challenger won,\\r\nthen struck a victory pose and gave an epic speech!"
msgstr "¡Pero que pelea más épica! ¡El retador salió victorioso,\\r\nposó como todo un héroe y dió un discurso que puso la piel de gallina!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "132_Chief Operating Officer"
msgid "I've never seen anything like it in all my life!\\r\nI sure wish you could've been there."
msgstr "¡En toda mi vida, nunca vi algo igual!\\r \nOjalá lo hubieras visto con tus propios ojos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "144_Chief Executive Officer"
msgid "You should've come to get me! I'm afraid this little lapse\\r\nwill reflect negatively on your annual assessment."
msgstr "¡Podrías haberme buscado!\\r \nMe temo que este desliz te va a costar caro en tu evaluación anual."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "156_Chief Operating Officer"
msgid "Hm..."
msgstr "Mm..."
